---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — RigPure"
  description="Get in touch with RigPure: corrections, tips, and advertising or partnership enquiries."
  active="contact"
>
  <div class="article-wrap"><div class="container">
    <article class="prose" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <p class="dek">Got a correction, a tip, or a business enquiry? Pick the right line below — it helps us route your message faster.</p>

      <div class="stat-panel" style="margin:24px 0">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-name">Editorial &amp; corrections</span></div>
          <a href="mailto:contact@rigpure.com?subject=Correction%20or%20tip" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" style="margin-top:6px">contact@rigpure.com</a>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-name">Advertising &amp; partnerships</span></div>
          <a href="mailto:ads@rigpure.com?subject=Advertising%20enquiry" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" style="margin-top:6px">ads@rigpure.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>What to send</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Found a mistake?</strong> Tell us the article URL and what's wrong — we correct factual errors as soon as we can verify them.</li>
        <li><strong>Got a game we should cover?</strong> Send the title and a line on why it's worth our time.</li>
        <li><strong>Press kit, embargo or review code?</strong> Include platform and availability window.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising or affiliate partnership?</strong> Use the ads address above with a short brief.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="callout info">
        <span class="c-label">Response time</span>
        <p>We're a small team — expect a reply within a few business days. Editorial independence means review coverage is never guaranteed in exchange for review code or advertising.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Legal &amp; privacy requests</h2>
      <p>For data protection or legal notice enquiries, see our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/legal-notice">Legal Notice</a>, or email <a href="mailto:contact@rigpure.com">contact@rigpure.com</a> directly.</p>
    </article>
  </div></div>
</BaseLayout>
